# NOTE: web/package-lock.json is deliberately COMMITTED so `npm ci` reproduces
# the exact dependency tree the Phase 3A/3B validation gates were run against.

# NOTE: web/src/data/generated/*.json is deliberately COMMITTED.
# The frontend imports those artifacts at build time, so committing them keeps
# the build reproducible without requiring a Python toolchain. Verify freshness
# with: cd pipeline && python -m pipeline.build --check
